      "op": "say",
      "text": "Engineering constraint: keep the page genuinely offline-safe\u2014no remote fonts, images, scripts, or embedded map; use local assets and a plain-text fictional address/hours. Also make every CTA informational only (no order/checkout/contact submission or data capture)."
